{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 87,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        36.0,
        21.884788513183594,
        63.09400177001953,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Second",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        80.6412353515625,
        513.3946533203125,
        93.99273681640625
      ],
      "text": "Do second-line DST in all MDR-TB cases to exclude resistance to the fluoroquinolones",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        84.31314086914062,
        91.36740112304688,
        92.31314086914062
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        96.63775634765625,
        510.1975402832031,
        109.9892578125
      ],
      "text": "and/or second-line injectables, as this may call for additional drugs early in therapy.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        118.6412353515625,
        513.4060668945312,
        131.99273681640625
      ],
      "text": "Give at least three (only in early primary disease) or preferably four drugs to which",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        122.31314086914062,
        91.36740112304688,
        130.31314086914062
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        134.63775634765625,
        436.2870788574219,
        147.9892578125
      ],
      "text": "the patient or adult source case is naive or their isolates susceptible.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        156.6412353515625,
        513.4751586914062,
        169.99273681640625
      ],
      "text": "Caregivers need counselling and support at every follow-up visit regarding adverse",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        160.31314086914062,
        91.36740112304688,
        168.31314086914062
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        172.63775634765625,
        513.4290771484375,
        185.9892578125
      ],
      "text": "effects, treatment duration and importance of adherence. In addition, the following",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        188.63427734375,
        404.58154296875,
        201.98577880859375
      ],
      "text": "assessment of the child should be undertaken as a minimum:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        208.44122314453125,
        227.18638610839844,
        221.90773010253906
      ],
      "text": "symptom assessment; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        227.9105224609375,
        297.69287109375,
        241.3770294189453
      ],
      "text": "assessment of treatment adherence; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        247.37982177734375,
        312.19439697265625,
        260.8463134765625
      ],
      "text": "enquiry about any adverse events; and  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        267.4490966796875,
        227.62338256835938,
        280.91558837890625
      ],
      "text": "weight measurement. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        106.33940124511719,
        287.5184326171875,
        427.1664123535156,
        300.86993408203125
      ],
      "text": "Drug dosages should be adjusted to account for any weight gain.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        309.5184326171875,
        513.3831176757812,
        322.86993408203125
      ],
      "text": "Clinical, radiographic and culture response to treatment should be monitored.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        313.1903381347656,
        91.36740112304688,
        321.1903381347656
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        325.5149230957031,
        513.4522094726562,
        338.8664245605469
      ],
      "text": "Monthly smear microscopy and cultures should be done until confirmed negative",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        341.51141357421875,
        513.4634399414062,
        354.8629150390625
      ],
      "text": "on three consecutive occasions; thereafter, follow-up cultures can be done every 2-3",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        357.5079040527344,
        145.14149475097656,
        370.8594055175781
      ],
      "text": "months.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        379.518310546875,
        513.4635620117188,
        392.86981201171875
      ],
      "text": "Clinical monitoring for adverse effects should be done at every visit. Special",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        383.1902160644531,
        91.36740112304688,
        391.1902160644531
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        395.5148010253906,
        491.728515625,
        408.8663024902344
      ],
      "text": "investigations should be guided by the adverse effect profile of the drugs used.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        417.5143127441406,
        513.509521484375,
        430.8658142089844
      ],
      "text": "While any of the drugs described in Table 9 might be used in the treatment of children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        433.51080322265625,
        513.440673828125,
        446.8623046875
      ],
      "text": "with MDR-TB, safety data in children currently exist only for fluoroquinolones, and so",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        449.5072937011719,
        513.383056640625,
        462.8587951660156
      ],
      "text": "the WHO recommendation on the treatment of MDR-TB in children addresses the use",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        465.5037841796875,
        513.4404907226562,
        478.85528564453125
      ],
      "text": "only of fluoroquinolones. There is a need for safety data on other drugs that are being",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        481.5002746582031,
        303.7955017089844,
        494.8517761230469
      ],
      "text": "used for treatment of children with MDR-TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        508.5252685546875,
        213.58949279785156,
        522.1527709960938
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 27 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        532.30078125,
        513.2846069335938,
        547.634765625
      ],
      "text": "Children with proven or suspected pulmonary TB or tuberculous meningitis",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        545.5008544921875,
        513.2626342773438,
        560.8348388671875
      ],
      "text": "caused by multi-drug resistant bacilli can be treated with a fluoroquinolone in",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        558.7008056640625,
        510.2265625,
        574.0347900390625
      ],
      "text": "the context of a well-functioning MDR-TB control programme and within an ap-",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        571.90087890625,
        513.2847290039062,
        587.23486328125
      ],
      "text": "propriate MDR-TB regimen. The decision to treat should be taken by a clinician",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        585.100830078125,
        307.82635498046875,
        600.434814453125
      ],
      "text": "experienced in managing paediatric TB",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        610.6221923828125,
        357.40740966796875,
        623.9736938476562
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low quality evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        635.3587036132812,
        513.47412109375,
        648.7791748046875
      ],
      "text": "Rapid advice: treatment of tuberculosis in children. Source:   Geneva, World Health",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        649.1587524414062,
        347.0459289550781,
        662.5792236328125
      ],
      "text": "(12). Organization, 2010 (WHO/HTM/TB/2010.13)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        679.7814331054688,
        125.70940399169922,
        696.637451171875
      ],
      "text": "7.6\t I",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        125.92539978027344,
        683.7882690429688,
        310.2434997558594,
        695.5874633789062
      ],
      "text": "mplementation considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        705.99072265625,
        321.0553894042969,
        722.71875
      ],
      "text": "Building a treatment regimen for MDR-TB",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        726.5648193359375,
        513.4721069335938,
        739.9163208007812
      ],
      "text": "Treatment regimens for children with MDR-TB follow the same principles as in adults",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        742.4923706054688,
        513.471923828125,
        755.912841796875
      ],
      "text": "(2, 4) . With extensive pulmonary or disseminated extrapulmonary disease, a minimum",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        758.5578002929688,
        513.35693359375,
        771.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "of four to six drugs should be included in the regimen, based on susceptibilities of the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        774.4853515625,
        342.1794128417969,
        787.9058227539062
      ],
      "text": "(10) isolate, as outlined in the following progression  :",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "68",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}